  m_text: "The human heart is a muscular organ\r\nthat pumps blood throughout the
    body.\r\n\r\nMain Parts:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Right Atrium\r\n\u2022 Right Ventricle\r\n\u2022
    Left Atrium\r\n\u2022 Left Ventricle\r\n\u2022 Aorta\r\n\r\nThe right side receives
    deoxygenated blood,\r\nwhile the left side pumps oxygenated blood\r\nto the body."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
